Package: spark-exporter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), ethtool, systemd
Suggests: nvidia-smi, tailscale
Description: read-only Spark host, GPU, network and inference metrics exporter
 Bundles an isolated, loopback-only Prometheus node_exporter for standard host
 metrics and adds GPU, process, unified-memory, RDMA and Ethernet diagnostics.
 The inference metrics proxy uses bounded passive loopback requests; model
 supervisor status remains opt-in.
 .
 The main service listens on 127.0.0.1:9400 by default. No container runtime,
 frontend, inference service or NVIDIA driver installation is required.
 NVIDIA metrics use nvidia-smi from an already installed driver, if present.
